@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@managerToken = replace-with-your-own-manager-access-token

### Manager audit history: exclusive end, UTC timestamps, bounded page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit/logs?entityType=Order&fromUtc=2026-11-19T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-11-20T00:00:00Z&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid bounds: 400 application/problem+json with code audit.query.invalid
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit/logs?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
